{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3236390/extras/collegue3.gif?t=1742578392\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>PAGER</strong> is a 1-bit 3D Kafkaesque horror game set in a 90s office building. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It\u2019s your first day at work, and to succeed, you must follow the pager\u2019s instructions carefully.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3236390/extras/catch3.gif?t=1742578392\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>pager (noun)  </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>A pocket-sized radio device that allows users to receive read-only messages.</i>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3236390/extras/secret3.gif?t=1742578392\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>FEATURES</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">1-bit 3D graphics. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Short, weird, and beautiful. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lots of first-person walking. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Caffeine-addict butterflies. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Palette and glow effect settings. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3236390/extras/ladder3.gif?t=1742578392\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is<strong>\u00a0</strong>a 10-floor demo! I hope you enjoy it, and I\u2019d love to hear what you think.</p><p class=\"bb_par